  "reflectionText": "David lifted his voice in the chamber of his house: bless the Lord, my soul. He remembered all his benefits, his forgiveness, his healing, his redeeming, his compassion like a father's. The harp grew still in his hands. What is the gratitude of speaking to your own soul, and reminding it of everything it has been given?"
